{{ToonInfo|Toon=Finn|extra=Fish Bowl|Date=August 14th, 2024|with={{CI|Cosmo|name=true}}, {{CI|Glisten|name=true}}, and {{CI|Sprout|name=true}}|Pronoun=He}}

==Appearance==
Finn is a light blue fishbowl that's filled with water. He has an outline that's colored a darker shade of blue, and he wears an orange life jacket and white trousers with orange stripes. He also has a missing tooth.<ref>https://discordapp.com/channels/969934252844138496/1251545388259741768/1276202099147018301</ref> During his walking animation, he spills water out of his head (possibly indicating that his contents are not vital to his survival). It is mentioned in multiple interactions of his that there is a toy fish named [[Barnaby Wilikers]] in his head. In his 2nd idle, Swimmy Barnaby Machines, and extraction animations, Barnaby is visible as a striped, purple wind-up toy fish.

==Personality==
Finn is an energetic and extroverted [[Toon]]. He has an interest in sea life and likes to talk about it with the other Toons, especially in the form of fish puns. He sometimes can go overboard on it and continue making puns, even if a Toon doesn't like it, based on his interaction with {{CI|Glisten|name=true}}. He seems to struggle picking up on social cues or noticing another Toon's feelings, to the point of making {{CI|Squirm|name=true}} distressed, though he isn’t malicious, merely unintentionally annoying or upsetting others. He can also be somewhat forgetful, such as forgetting not to get too close to {{CI|Vee|name=true}}, based on their interaction together.

Finn appears to be a people pleaser based on the VHS in the [[Aquatic Floor]]. He loves to educate and tell jokes, though in the video where he interacts with {{CI|Razzle & Dazzle|name=true}}, coming up with jokes with Razzle's help, he explains that the kids and customers want more jokes, giving in but wishing they’d listen to his facts too. In a cartoon clip, {{CI|Shelly|name=true}} tries to talk to Finn about fossils, but Finn shows no interest until she brings up shark fossils and/or underwater fossils, showing that Finn has little to no interest in anything else besides marine biology. He gets very excited when his interest in marine biology is acknowledged as shown when {{CI|Shrimpo|name=true}} accidentally reveals he listens to the facts or when {{CI|Rodger|name=true}} compliments his intelligence in the field followed by bringing up a fact he recalls.

Overall, Finn is a joyful Toon who tries his best to make others laugh with his jokes or amazed at his facts that may be unappealing or annoying to some, likely telling the jokes to stay on other Toon's good side.

